<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8616"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 24, 2005 - 5:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->According to his current status, he was released/paroled out of state on March 23rd 2004. So on March 17th he was not in Wichita, he was at Oaklahoma State.  <BR> <BR>  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
